WEBVTT

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:01.067
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:03.467
<v><b>F:</b></v> Can I <b>help you</b>?

00:00:05.708 --> 00:00:06.295
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:07.483 --> 00:00:08.851
<v><b>M:</b></v> <b>Where</b> can I <b>sit down</b>?

00:00:11.022 --> 00:00:11.735
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:12.975 --> 00:00:14.737
<v><b>F:</b></v> <b>Sorry</b>, I <b>can’t</b>.

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:17.576
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:19.004 --> 00:00:20.217
<v><b>M:</b></v> <b>Yes</b>, you <b>can</b>.

00:00:22.415 --> 00:00:23.144
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:24.576 --> 00:00:26.544
<v><b>F:</b></v> You can <b>learn</b> to <b>drive here</b>.

00:00:28.704 --> 00:00:29.480
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:30.839 --> 00:00:32.472
<v><b>M:</b></v> I <b>can’t speak Polish</b>.